flowchart TB
  dev[GitHub push / PR] --> ci[CI: ruff, pytest, SAFETY SUITE,<br/>image build, smoke test on pgvector, Trivy]
  ci --> tag[Tag / manual dispatch]
  tag --> cd[CD: GitHub OIDC - no long-lived keys]
  cd --> ecr[(ECR - immutable tags,<br/>scan on push, KMS)]
  cd --> eks
  subgraph aws[AWS ap-southeast-2 - same region as the database]
    subgraph eks[EKS - secrets KMS-encrypted, NetworkPolicies]
      ing[ALB Ingress TLS] --> pod1[app pod]
      ing --> pod2[app pod]
      pod1 --> rd[(Redis - only app may connect)]
      pod2 --> rd
    end
  end
  pod1 --> supa[(Supabase Postgres + Auth)]
  pod2 --> models{{EURI / Gemini / Groq / Tavily}}
